Prior to feature-level screening, a sample-level integrity check was conducted to eliminate severe injection failures. Samples exhibiting an overall missing value rate exceeding the tolerance of **{{ sw.get('thresholds', {}).get('sample_mv_tol', 'N/A') }}** were excluded. This step evaluated **{{ sw_ret.get('total_checked', 'N/A') }}** samples, retaining **{{ sw_ret.get('retained_count', 'N/A') }}** samples (Retention rate: **{{ sw_ret.get('retention_rate_pct', 'N/A') }}**%).

